          deckDescription: 'A German playing card deck of 32 cards with four traditional German suits: Acorns, Leaves, Hearts, and Bells. Each suit contains eight ranks from 7 through Ace, commonly used in German and Central European card games.',
          suitDescription: 'Four German suits: Acorns (Eichel), Leaves (Grün/Gras), Hearts (Herz), and Bells (Schellen), each represented with distinctive traditional German card artwork and symbolism familiar to players of German-speaking regions.',
