        prompts: {
          human: "Hold at least one card of a quartet, then ask another player for a specific card. If they have it, they give it and you ask again. If not, they say 'Not at home' and their turn starts. Complete quartets go on the table. Most quartets wins.",
          ai: 'Game: Quartett. Progression: [Deal -> Ask -> Respond(give or not at home) -> same asker or pass turn -> Lay quartet when complete]. Ask specific player for specific card; must hold one of that quartet. Give = asker continues; not at home = their turn. 2p: asked draws 1 before asking. Most quartets wins.',
